    Standard, §5.3: “公司成立于 1998 年”.  
    **CONSISTENT.** This translates the standard’s rejected background example.

13. **“the product line launched in 2020”**  
    Standard, §5.3: “A100 2020 年上市”.  
    **CONSISTENT.** A bare historical launch date parallels the standard’s example; the wording is an adaptation, not an example on the page verbatim.

14. **“a typical claim that is common knowledge, without a figure and a specific account”**  
